<h2>Verdict: Are Under Desk Elliptical Benefits Worth It?</h2>
<p>For desk workers, remote workers and older adults, yes. The benefits are modest one by one, but they come with almost no extra time, and they compound with daily use. Expect more movement, a few hundred extra calories on a good day and legs that feel better by evening. Do not expect a gym replacement.</p>
